Chapter: DataPageArm
  cites WebApp chapter WebRuntime
  cites Data chapter Page
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 The page codex/plugs/html/arms/data-page.mjs drives: a Data quire page made,
 a row inserted and read back, which takes alloc-bytes and the byte heap.

 We say:

Section: Round Trip

  opening : [Console] Integer
  opening =
    let pg = page-new 7 page-type-data
    in let (p2, slot, ok) = page-insert pg [1, 2, 3, 250]
    in let a = state-set "inserted" (if ok then 1 else 0)
    in let b = state-set "free" (page-free-space p2)
    in let c = state-set-text "row" (dpa-row (page-read-slot p2 slot))
    in state-set "done" 1

  dpa-row : Maybe (List Integer) -> Text
  dpa-row (m) =
    when m
      is Just (bytes) -> dpa-join bytes 0 ""
      is None -> "none"

  dpa-join : List Integer, Integer, Text -> Text
  dpa-join (xs) (i) (acc) =
    if i >= list-length xs then acc
    else dpa-join xs (i + 1) (if i == 0 then show (list-at xs i) else acc & "," & show (list-at xs i))
